flowchart TB
accTitle: Two post-launch detection paths
accDescr: Config change evaluation or scheduled inventory can detect an unapproved running AMI, after which a current-state recheck precedes termination and notification.
L[EC2 test instance launches]:::inputData --> C[Config evaluates AMI ID]:::process
L --> P[Scheduled inventory checks AMI ID]:::process
C --> R{Currently running an unapproved AMI?}:::decision
P --> R
R -->|Yes| T[Terminate instance]:::warning
T --> N[Notify security through SNS]:::output
R -->|No| K[No remediation]:::output
W[Detection window exists after launch]:::reference -.-> L
